    "title": "Kira Ganga Kieffer at The Westport Library",
    "text": "Vaccine hesitancy in America didn’t begin with the uproar over the mRNA vaccines for Covid-19. The late twentieth and early twenty-first centuries saw resistance to a wide variety of vaccines. In her new book, Kira Ganga Kieffer shows that debates over vaccine safety and mandatory vaccination were about more than diseases or injections. Please join The Westport Library in welcoming Kira Ganga Kieffer, author of Unvaccinated Under God.\nEvents\nJune 04, 2026",
